    <div class="entry-content" set:html={`<p class="" data-start="66" data-end="305">亚麻籽壳, 亚麻籽行业经常被忽视, 挤满了 <strong data-start="141" data-end="184">纤维, 木脂素类, 和必需营养素</strong>, 使它们有价值 <strong data-start="212" data-end="270">功能性食品原料及提取原料</strong>. 在本文中, 我们将探索:</p><p class="" data-start="307" data-end="560">✔ <strong data-start="309" data-end="335">什么是亚麻籽壳?</strong><br data-start="335" data-end="338" />✔ <strong data-start="340" data-end="370">亚麻籽壳可以吃吗?</strong><br data-start="370" data-end="373" />✔ <strong data-start="375" data-end="415">亚麻籽壳中含有什么营养成分?</strong><br data-start="415" data-end="418" />✔ <strong data-start="420" data-end="457">亚麻籽壳是如何加工的?</strong><br data-start="457" data-end="460" />✔ <strong data-start="462" data-end="503">亚麻籽壳提取应用</strong><br data-start="503" data-end="506" />✔ <strong data-start="508" data-end="558">哪里可以买到工业用亚麻籽壳</strong></p><hr class="" data-start="562" data-end="567" /><h2 data-start="569" data-end="603"><img src="/images/flaxseeds-linseed-hulls-3-300x300.jpg" decoding="async" class="alignnone  wp-image-926" alt="flaxseed hull" width="583" height="583" title="亚麻籽壳: 营养, 用途, 提取过程, 批量销售 3" /></h2><div id="ez-toc-container" class="ez-toc-v2_0_85 counter-hierarchy ez-toc-counter ez-toc-grey ez-toc-container-direction"><div class="ez-toc-title-container"><p class="ez-toc-title" style="cursor:inherit">目录</p>
