f_Flaxseed_Hull_as_a_Food_Ingredient" >亚麻籽壳作为食品成分的优点:</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-7" href="#Disadvantages" >缺点:</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-8" href="#3_What_Can_Be_Extracted_from_Flaxseed_Hull" >3. 亚麻籽壳可以提取什么?</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-9" href="#4_How_is_Flaxseed_Hull_Processed" >4. 亚麻籽壳是如何加工的?</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-10" href="#Flaxseed_Hull_Processing_Flowchart" >亚麻籽壳加工流程图</a></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-11" href="#Main_Processing_Technologies" >主要加工技术</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-12" href="#5_How_to_Buy_Flaxseed_Hull_for_Industrial_Use" >5. 如何购买工业用亚麻籽壳?</a><ul class='ez-toc-list-level-3' ><li class='ez-toc-heading-level-3'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-13" href="#%F0%9F%93%9E_Contact_Us_for_Bulk_Flaxseed_Hull_Supply" >📞 联系我们获取散装亚麻籽壳供应</a></li></ul></li><li class='ez-toc-page-1 ez-toc-heading-level-2'><a class="ez-toc-link ez-toc-heading-14" href="#Conclusion" >结论</a></li></ul></nav></div><h2 class="" data-start="569" data-end="603"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="1_What_is_Flaxseed_Hull"></span><strong data-start="572" data-end="601">1. 什么是亚麻籽壳?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="604" data-end="844">亚麻籽壳 (或亚麻籽壳) 是 <strong data-start="645" data-end="671">外保护层</strong> 亚麻籽的. 它含有高浓度的 <strong data-start="723" data-end="769">膳食纤维, 木脂素类, 和微量营养素</strong>, 其中提供了多个 <strong data-start="794" data-end="841">健康益处和工业应用</strong>.</p><h3 class="" data-start="846" data-end="882"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Are_Flaxseed_Hulls_Edible"></span><strong data-start="850" data-end="880">亚麻籽壳可以吃吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p class="" data-start="883" data-end="1137">是的, 亚麻籽壳是 <strong data-start="907" data-end="922">可以安全食用</strong> 通常包含在膳食补充剂和功能性食品中. 然而, 因为他们是 <strong data-start="1023" data-end="1050">不溶性纤维含量高</strong>, 大量食用它们可能会导致某些人消化不适.</p><h3 class="" data-start="1139" data-end="1180"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Can_You_Chew_on_Flaxseed_Hulls"></span><strong data-start="1143" data-end="1178">你能咀嚼亚麻籽壳吗?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p class="" data-start="1181" data-end="1361">亚麻籽壳坚韧且富含纤维, 使它们难以咀嚼. 反而, 他们通常是 <strong data-start="1276" data-end="1298">磨成粉末</strong> 或者 <strong data-start="1302" data-end="1315">提取的</strong> 最大化他们的 <strong data-start="1334" data-end="1358">营养益处</strong>.</p><h3 class="" data-start="1363" data-end="1408"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="What_Vitamins_Are_in_Flaxseed_Hull"></span><strong data-start="1367" data-end="1406">亚麻籽壳中含有哪些维生素?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p class="" data-start="1409" data-end="1572">亚麻籽壳含有 <strong data-start="1432" data-end="1446">B族维生素</strong>, 尤其 <strong data-start="1459" data-end="1505">B1 (硫胺素), B6 (吡哆醇), 和叶酸</strong>, 在新陈代谢和细胞功能中发挥重要作用.</p><hr class="" data-start="1574" data-end="1579" /><h2 class="" data-start="1581" data-end="1630"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="2_Flaxseed_Hull_Nutritional_Composition"></span><strong data-start="1584" data-end="1628">2. 亚麻籽壳营养成分</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="1631" data-end="1775">下面是 <strong data-start="1644" data-end="1667">营养成分</strong> 基于美国农业部实验室分析和已发表研究的亚麻籽壳 (张等人。, 2022):</p><div class="overflow-x-auto contain-inline-size"><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="1777" data-end="2616"><thead data-start="1777" data-end="1828"><tr data-start="1777" data-end="1828"><th data-start="1777" data-end="1798"><strong data-start="1779" data-end="1791">养分</strong></th><th data-start="1798" data-end="1813"><strong data-start="1800" data-end="1812">每100克</strong></th><th data-start="1813" data-end="1828"><strong data-start="1815" data-end="1826">益处</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="1879" data-end="2616"><tr data-start="1879" data-end="1965"><td><strong data-start="1881" data-end="1898">膳食纤维</strong></td><td>48-52克</td><td>支持消化, 肠道健康, 和体重管理</td></tr><tr data-start="1966" data-end="2063"><td><strong data-start="1968" data-end="1979">木酚素</strong></td><td>1,200-2,500 毫克</td><td>强大的抗氧化剂，具有潜在的激素平衡作用</td></tr><tr data-start="2064" data-end="2140"><td><strong data-start="2066" data-end="2077">蛋白质</strong></td><td>12-16克</td><td>提供身体功能必需的氨基酸</td></tr><tr data-start="2141" data-end="2218"><td><strong data-start="2143" data-end="2160">欧米伽3 (翼)</strong></td><td>3-4克</td><td>支持心脏健康并减少炎症</td></tr><tr data-start="2219" data-end="2286"><td><strong data-start="2221" data-end="2238">B1 (硫胺素)</strong></td><td>0.8-1.2毫克</td><td>对于能量代谢至关重要</td></tr><tr data-start="2287" data-end="2380"><td><strong data-start="2289" data-end="2308">B6 (吡哆醇)</strong></td><td>0.3-0.5毫克</td><td>支持大脑功能和神经递质的产生</td></tr><tr data-start="2381" data-end="2455"><td><strong data-start="2383" data-end="2393">叶酸</strong></td><td>100-150 微球蛋白</td><td>对于细胞生长和 DNA 合成很重要</td></tr><tr data-start="2456" data-end="2532"><td><strong data-start="2458" data-end="2469">钙</strong></td><td>200-250毫克</td><td>强化骨骼并支持肌肉功能</td></tr><tr data-start="2533" data-end="2616"><td><strong data-start="2535" data-end="2548">镁</strong></td><td>250-350毫克</td><td>对于肌肉放松和酶功能至关重要</td></tr></tbody></table></div><h3 class="" data-start="2618" data-end="2677"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Advantages_of_Flaxseed_Hull_as_a_Food_Ingredient"></span><strong data-start="2622" data-end="2675">亚麻籽壳作为食品成分的优点:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p class="" data-start="2678" data-end="2894">✅ <strong data-start="2680" data-end="2697">高纤维</strong> – 支持肠道健康和体重管理.<br data-start="2742" data-end="2745" />✅ <strong data-start="2747" data-end="2766">富含木脂素</strong> – 潜在的抗氧化和激素平衡作用.<br data-start="2821" data-end="2824" />✅ <strong data-start="2826" data-end="2852">omega-3 的良好来源</strong> – 有益于心血管健康.</p><h3 class="" data-start="2896" data-end="2920"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Disadvantages"></span><strong data-start="2900" data-end="2918">缺点:</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p class="" data-start="2921" data-end="3118">❌ <strong data-start="2923" data-end="2945">高纤维含量</strong> – 如果过量食用可能会导致腹胀或消化不适.<br data-start="3013" data-end="3016" />❌ <strong data-start="3018" data-end="3053">整体形式消化率低</strong> – 必须研磨或提取以获得最佳营养吸收.</p><hr class="" data-start="3120" data-end="3125" /><h2 class="" data-start="3127" data-end="3180"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_What_Can_Be_Extracted_from_Flaxseed_Hull"></span><strong data-start="3130" data-end="3178">3. 亚麻籽壳可以提取什么?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="3182" data-end="3348">亚麻籽壳是 <strong data-start="3201" data-end="3226">宝贵的原材料</strong> 用于各种提取. 这是可以提取内容的详细列表, 他们的提取过程, 和应用:</p><div class="overflow-x-auto contain-inline-size"><table border="1" cellspacing="0" cellpadding="2" data-start="3350" data-end="4389"><thead data-start="3350" data-end="3418"><tr data-start="3350" data-end="3418"><th data-start="3350" data-end="3364"><strong data-start="3352" data-end="3363">提炼</strong></th><th data-start="3364" data-end="3389"><strong data-start="3366" data-end="3388">提取过程</strong></th><th data-start="3389" data-end="3418"><strong data-start="3391" data-end="3414">用途 &amp; 申请</strong></th></tr></thead><tbody data-start="3470" data-end="4389"><tr data-start="3470" data-end="3720"><td><strong data-start="3472" data-end="3523">木酚素 (开环异落叶松树脂醇二葡萄糖苷, 可持续发展目标)</strong></td><td>① <strong data-start="3528" data-end="3550">磨削 &amp; 筛分</strong> 亚麻籽壳 → ② <strong data-start="3569" data-end="3607">溶剂萃取 (乙醇/水)</strong> → ③ <strong data-start="3612" data-end="3647">通过色谱法纯化</strong></td><td>功能性食品补充剂, 荷尔蒙平衡, 抗氧化产品</td></tr><tr data-start="3721" data-end="3904"><td><strong data-start="3723" data-end="3741">亚麻籽纤维</strong></td><td>① <strong data-start="3746" data-end="3771">机械分离</strong> → ② <strong data-start="3776" data-end="3811">水解以分解纤维</strong> → ③ <strong data-start="3816" data-end="3840">干燥及包装</strong></td><td>膳食纤维补充剂, 无麸质烘焙原料</td></tr><tr data-start="3905" data-end="4068"><td><strong data-start="3907" data-end="3932">亚麻籽壳蛋白</strong></td><td>① <strong data-start="3937" data-end="3960">碱提法</strong> → ② <strong data-start="3965" data-end="3994">等电沉淀</strong> → ③ <strong data-start="3999" data-end="4016">冷冻干燥</strong></td><td>植物蛋白粉, 功能性食品</td></tr><tr data-start="4069" data-end="4217"><td><strong data-start="4071" data-end="4092">Omega-3 油 (翼)</strong></td><td>① <strong data-start="4097" data-end="4129">超临界二氧化碳萃取</strong> → ② <strong data-start="4134" data-end="4170">微胶囊稳定性</strong></td><td>营养补充剂, 功能性油</td></tr><tr data-start="4218" data-end="4389"><td><strong data-start="4220" data-end="4257">酚类化合物 &amp; 抗氧化剂</strong></td><td>① <strong data-start="4262" data-end="4284">乙醇萃取</strong> → ② <strong data-start="4289" data-end="4321">过滤浓缩</strong></td><td>天然食品防腐剂, 抗氧化护肤配方</td></tr></tbody></table></div><hr class="" data-start="4391" data-end="4396" /><h2 class="" data-start="4398" data-end="4441"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="4_How_is_Flaxseed_Hull_Processed"></span><strong data-start="4401" data-end="4439">4. 亚麻籽壳是如何加工的?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><h3 class="" data-start="4443" data-end="4487"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Flaxseed_Hull_Processing_Flowchart"></span><strong data-start="4447" data-end="4485">亚麻籽壳加工流程图</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p class="" data-start="4488" data-end="4888">1️⃣ <strong data-start="4492" data-end="4513">亚麻籽清洗</strong> – 去除杂质 (灰尘, 石头).<br data-start="4549" data-end="4552" />2️⃣ <strong data-start="4556" data-end="4569">脱壳</strong> – 机械地将外壳与内部种子分离.<br data-start="4629" data-end="4632" />3️⃣ <strong data-start="4636" data-end="4657">筛分 &amp; 排序</strong> – 根据颗粒大小分离外壳部分.<br data-start="4707" data-end="4710" />4️⃣ <strong data-start="4714" data-end="4734">烘干 &amp; 铣削</strong> – 风干并研磨成粉末或颗粒以供进一步使用.<br data-start="4798" data-end="4801" />5️⃣ <strong data-start="4805" data-end="4818">包装</strong> – 储存在食品级散装袋或提取物制备容器中.</p><h3 class="" data-start="4890" data-end="4928"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Main_Processing_Technologies"></span><strong data-start="4894" data-end="4926">主要加工技术</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4929" data-end="5195"><li class="" data-start="4929" data-end="5025"><p class="" data-start="4931" data-end="5025"><strong data-start="4931" data-end="4960">干式机械分离</strong> – 保留营养完整性，但提取率较低.</p></li><li class="" data-start="5026" data-end="5098"><p class="" data-start="5028" data-end="5098"><strong data-start="5028" data-end="5052">酶水解</strong> – 提高木酚素和蛋白质的利用率.</p></li><li class="" data-start="5099" data-end="5195"><p class="" data-start="5101" data-end="5195"><strong data-start="5101" data-end="5133">超临界二氧化碳萃取</strong> – 生产高纯度的油提取物，氧化程度最低.</p></li></ul><hr class="" data-start="5197" data-end="5202" /><h2 class="" data-start="5204" data-end="5260"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="5_How_to_Buy_Flaxseed_Hull_for_Industrial_Use"></span><strong data-start="5207" data-end="5258">5. 如何购买工业用亚麻籽壳?</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="5262" data-end="5409">如果您正在寻找 <strong data-start="5284" data-end="5324">购买优质亚麻籽壳</strong> 用于食品加工, 补充生产, 或提取, 考虑以下因素:</p><p class="" data-start="5411" data-end="5613">📌 <strong data-start="5414" data-end="5443">要检查的质量因素:</strong><br data-start="5443" data-end="5446" />✔ 木酚素含量 (≥ 1,500 毫克每100克)<br data-start="5484" data-end="5487" />✔ 水分含量 (&lt; 8%)<br data-start="5512" data-end="5515" />✔ 粒径 (基于预期应用)<br data-start="5562" data-end="5565" />✔ 无重金属、无农药认证</p><p class="" data-start="5615" data-end="5674">📌 <strong data-start="5618" data-end="5672">普通包装 &amp; 最小订购量 (起订量):</strong></p><ul data-start="5675" data-end="5834"><li class="" data-start="5675" data-end="5724"><p class="" data-start="5677" data-end="5724"><strong data-start="5677" data-end="5713">食品级亚麻籽壳粉:</strong> 20公斤/袋</p></li><li class="" data-start="5725" data-end="5773"><p class="" data-start="5727" data-end="5773"><strong data-start="5727" data-end="5751">富含木酚素的提取物:</strong> 1千克密封包装</p></li><li class="" data-start="5774" data-end="5834"><p class="" data-start="5776" data-end="5834"><strong data-start="5776" data-end="5806">工业散货运输:</strong> 500kg – 1吨超级麻袋</p></li></ul><p class="" data-start="5836" data-end="5864">📌 <strong data-start="5839" data-end="5862">船运 &amp; 贮存:</strong></p><ul data-start="5865" data-end="5983"><li class="" data-start="5865" data-end="5920"><p class="" data-start="5867" data-end="5920"><strong data-start="5867" data-end="5892">需要冷藏</strong> 用于富含木酚素的提取物.</p></li><li class="" data-start="5921" data-end="5983"><p class="" data-start="5923" data-end="5983"><strong data-start="5923" data-end="5955">标准温度储存</strong> 用于壳粉或纤维.</p></li></ul><h3 class="" data-start="5985" data-end="6038"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="%F0%9F%93%9E_Contact_Us_for_Bulk_Flaxseed_Hull_Supply"></span><strong data-start="5989" data-end="6036">📞 联系我们获取散装亚麻籽壳供应</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><p class="" data-start="6039" data-end="6166">如需查询 <strong data-start="6059" data-end="6146">大量采购亚麻籽壳, 定制提取解决方案, 或供应商合作伙伴关系</strong>, <a href="/zh/contact-us/"><strong>联系我们</strong></a></p><hr class="" data-start="6306" data-end="6309" /><h2 class="" data-start="6311" data-end="6330"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="Conclusion"></span><strong data-start="6314" data-end="6328">结论</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><p class="" data-start="6331" data-end="6593">亚麻籽壳是 <strong data-start="6350" data-end="6378">营养丰富的副产品</strong> 与应用程序 <strong data-start="6400" data-end="6449">食物, 补品, 和工业提取</strong>. 这是 <strong data-start="6457" data-end="6497">富含纤维, 木脂素类, 和 omega-3</strong>, 使其成为广受欢迎的成分 <strong data-start="6538" data-end="6590">保健品和功能性食品配方</strong>.</p><p class="" data-start="6595" data-end="6752">📢 <strong data-start="6598" data-end="6752" data-is-last-node="">如果您是食品制造商, 补充剂品牌, 或寻找优质亚麻籽壳的原料供应商, 联系我们了解定价和样品请求!</strong></p>`} />
